          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Does the path to `ws.css` need to be updated in the .adoc files?  \n`CUSTOMBUILD : warning : C:/gitlab-builds/builds/MsQ3pox2/0/wireshark/wireshark/doc/man_pages/wireshark-filter.adoc: stylesheet does not exist or cannot be read: C:/gitlab-builds/builds/MsQ3pox2/0/wireshark/wireshark/doc/docbook/ws.css [C:\\gitlab-builds\\builds\\MsQ3pox2\\0\\wireshark\\wireshark\\build\\doc\\docs.vcxproj]`",
